{"4501510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sorcery Mastery", "steam_appid": 4501510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Sorcery Mastery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, competitive multiplayer action RPG where mages clash in high-intensity matches inside a shrinking arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters to earn gold and experience, then shape your mage by choosing sorceries, items, and masteries that fit your strategy and synergise well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sorcery is tied to an element, each best suited to a different playstyle:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 FIRE: consistent area damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💨 AIR: high speed and crowd control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪨 EARTH: high defence and close range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💦 WATER: low cooldowns and long range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❄️ ICE: large area crowd control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ THUNDER: rapid burst damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 PLANT: regeneration and crowd control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ More to be announced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining elements triggers special combos, encouraging hybrid builds. Every match creates new builds for both you and your enemies, forcing you to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sorcery Mastery blends fast arcade combat with strategic build crafting. Whether on keyboard or controller, clever choices and skilful play lead to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart! Outbuild! Outplay!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Sorcery Mastery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, competitive multiplayer action RPG where mages clash in high-intensity matches inside a shrinking arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters to earn gold and experience, then shape your mage by choosing sorceries, items, and masteries that fit your strategy and synergise well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sorcery is tied to an element, each best suited to a different playstyle:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 FIRE: consistent area damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💨 AIR: high speed and crowd control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪨 EARTH: high defence and close range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💦 WATER: low cooldowns and long range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❄️ ICE: large area crowd control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ THUNDER: rapid burst damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 PLANT: regeneration and crowd control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ More to be announced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining elements triggers special combos, encouraging hybrid builds. Every match creates new builds for both you and your enemies, forcing you to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sorcery Mastery blends fast arcade combat with strategic build crafting. Whether on keyboard or controller, clever choices and skilful play lead to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart! Outbuild! Outplay!</p>", "short_description": "Magical duels meet roguelike builds in this fast-paced multiplayer action RPG. Defeat monsters, craft your unique magic build by choosing sorceries, items, and masteries, then outplay your rival as the arena shrinks toward the final battle.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4501510/d384ff33ee274bd4dae6ddc41460f90f6161